      ":question/problem": "Triangles $\u25b3MNO$ and $\u25b3XYZ$ are plotted in the $xy$-plane. Triangle $\u25b3MNO$ has vertices $M$, $N$, and $O$ at $(3, 4)$, $(3, 8)$, and $(7, 4)$, respectively. Triangle $\u25b3XYZ$ has vertices $X$, $Y$, and $Z$ at $(3, 4)$, $(3, 4 + 4k)$, and $(3 + 4k, 4)$, respectively, where $k$ is a positive constant. If $m\u2220N = v^{\u2218} + 35^{\u2218}$, what is the measure of $\u2220Y$?"
