      ":question/problem": "Triangles $\u25b3ABC$ and $\u25b3DEF$ are plotted in the $xy$-plane. Triangle $\u25b3ABC$ has vertices $A$, $B$, and $C$ at $(3,-1)$, $(3, 2)$, and $(7,-1)$, respectively. Triangle $\u25b3DEF$ has vertices $D$, $E$, and $F$ at $(3,-1)$, $(3,-1 + 3k)$, and $(3 + 4k,-1)$, respectively, where $k$ is a positive constant. If $m\u2220B = t^{\u2218} - 5^{\u2218}$, what is the measure of $\u2220E$?"
